# {Project} — Information Architecture & Wireframes

## 1. Information Architecture (Site Map)
```mermaid
graph TD
    HOME["Home / Dashboard"] --> LIST["Resource List"]
    LIST --> DETAIL["Resource Detail"]
    DETAIL --> ACTION["Primary Action / Flow"]
    HOME --> SETTINGS["Account & Settings"]
```

## 2. Primary User Flows

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant Screen1 as List View
    participant Screen2 as Detail Modal
    participant System as App Engine

    User->>Screen1: Selects item from list
    Screen1->>Screen2: Opens detail overlay
    User->>Screen2: Clicks 'Confirm Action'
    Screen2->>System: Dispatches payload
    System-->>Screen2: Returns Success
    Screen2-->>Screen1: Updates list item state
```

